{
  "lessonId": "L1M3L1",
  "title": "五大紅葡萄品種",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8e44ad 0%,#9b59b6 100%)'><h1>🍇 義大利五大紅葡萄品種</h1><p class='subtitle'>從 Nebbiolo 到 Nero d'Avola 的風味之旅</p></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏆 五大紅葡萄品種概覽</h2><div class='grape-overview'><div class='overview-card nebbiolo'><div class='rank'>#1</div><div class='grape-name'>Nebbiolo</div><div class='grape-region'>Piemonte</div><div class='grape-fame'>Barolo, Barbaresco</div></div><div class='overview-card sangiovese'><div class='rank'>#2</div><div class='grape-name'>Sangiovese</div><div class='grape-region'>Tuscany</div><div class='grape-fame'>Chianti, Brunello</div></div><div class='overview-card barbera'><div class='rank'>#3</div><div class='grape-name'>Barbera</div><div class='grape-region'>Piemonte</div><div class='grape-fame'>Barbera d'Asti</div></div><div class='overview-card montepulciano'><div class='rank'>#4</div><div class='grape-name'>Montepulciano</div><div class='grape-region'>Abruzzo</div><div class='grape-fame'>Montepulciano d'Abruzzo</div></div><div class='overview-card nero'><div class='rank'>#5</div><div class='grape-name'>Nero d'Avola</div><div class='grape-region'>Sicily</div><div class='grape-fame'>西西里之王</div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>👑 Nebbiolo - 義大利之王</h2><div class='grape-detail'><div class='detail-header nebbiolo-bg'><h3>Nebbiolo</h3><p>霧中葡萄（Nebbia = 霧）</p></div><div class='detail-grid'><div class='detail-section'><h4>🎨 視覺特徵</h4><ul><li>顏色較淺（石榴紅）</li><li>邊緣呈現橘紅色</li><li>陳年後轉磚紅色</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>👃 香氣</h4><ul><li><strong>果香：</strong>櫻桃、草莓、覆盆子</li><li><strong>花香：</strong>玫瑰、紫羅蘭、薰衣草</li><li><strong>陳年後：</strong>松露、皮革、焦油、乾玫瑰</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>👅 口感</h4><ul><li><strong>單寧：</strong>非常高、堅實</li><li><strong>酸度：</strong>非常高</li><li><strong>酒體：</strong>中到飽滿</li><li><strong>酒精度：</strong>13.5-15%</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>🍷 代表酒款</h4><ul><li><strong>Barolo DOCG</strong> - 力量型</li><li><strong>Barbaresco DOCG</strong> - 優雅型</li><li>Roero DOCG</li><li>Gattinara DOCG</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>🍴 配餐</h4><ul><li>松露燉飯</li><li>燉牛肉、野味</li><li>陳年起司（Parmigiano）</li><li>紅肉、燉菜</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>⏱️ 陳年潛力</h4><ul><li>Barolo: 10-30 年</li><li>Barbaresco: 8-25 年</li><li>需要至少 5-10 年達到適飲期</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌟 Sangiovese - 托斯卡納之魂</h2><div class='grape-detail'><div class='detail-header sangiovese-bg'><h3>Sangiovese</h3><p>Jupiter 之血（Sanguis Jovis）</p></div><div class='detail-grid'><div class='detail-section'><h4>🎨 視覺特徵</h4><ul><li>中等寶石紅</li><li>帶紫色或磚紅色調</li><li>透明度適中</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>👃 香氣</h4><ul><li><strong>果香：</strong>酸櫻桃、紅莓、李子</li><li><strong>其他：</strong>番茄葉、香草、煙草</li><li><strong>陳年後：</strong>皮革、陳年香料、乾果</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>👅 口感</h4><ul><li><strong>單寧：</strong>中到高（堅實）</li><li><strong>酸度：</strong>高</li><li><strong>酒體：</strong>中到飽滿</li><li><strong>酒精度：</strong>12.5-14.5%</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>🍷 代表酒款</h4><ul><li><strong>Brunello di Montalcino DOCG</strong></li><li><strong>Chianti Classico DOCG</strong></li><li>Vino Nobile di Montepulciano DOCG</li><li>Super Tuscan（混釀）</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>🍴 配餐</h4><ul><li>番茄醬義大利麵</li><li>烤雞、牛排</li><li>Pecorino 起司</li><li>披薩</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>⏱️ 陳年潛力</h4><ul><li>Brunello: 15-30 年</li><li>Chianti Classico: 5-15 年</li><li>高酸度支撐長期陳年</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>💜 Barbera - 日常之星</h2><div class='grape-detail'><div class='detail-header barbera-bg'><h3>Barbera</h3><p>義大利第三大紅葡萄品種</p></div><div class='detail-grid'><div class='detail-section'><h4>🎨 視覺特徵</h4><ul><li>深紫紅色</li><li>顏色濃郁</li><li>不易褪色</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>👃 香氣</h4><ul><li><strong>果香：</strong>黑櫻桃、黑莓、李子</li><li><strong>其他：</strong>紫羅蘭、甘草</li><li><strong>橡木桶版：</strong>香草、烤堅果</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>👅 口感</h4><ul><li><strong>單寧：</strong>低到中（柔順）</li><li><strong>酸度：</strong>高（清爽）</li><li><strong>酒體：</strong>中到飽滿</li><li><strong>酒精度：</strong>12.5-14%</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>🍷 代表酒款</h4><ul><li><strong>Barbera d'Asti DOCG</strong></li><li><strong>Barbera d'Alba DOC</strong></li><li>Barbera del Monferrato DOC</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>🍴 配餐</h4><ul><li>義大利香腸</li><li>燉菜、咖哩</li><li>番茄料理</li><li>燒烤肉類</li></ul></div><div class='detail-section'><h4>💡 特色</h4><ul><li>低單寧 + 高酸度 = 百搭</li><li>性價比極高</li><li>可日常飲用</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Montepulciano & Nero d'Avola</h2><div class='two-grapes'><div class='grape-detail half'><div class='detail-header montepulciano-bg'><h3>Montepulciano</h3><p>中部大區主力</p></div><div class='detail-content'><div class='content-item'><strong>🎨 視覺：</strong>深紫紅、近乎不透明</div><div class='content-item'><strong>👃 香氣：</strong>黑櫻桃、李子、香料、黑巧克力</div><div class='content-item'><strong>👅 口感：</strong>單寧柔順、酸度中等、酒體飽滿</div><div class='content-item'><strong>🍷 代表：</strong>Montepulciano d'Abruzzo DOC</div><div class='content-item'><strong>🍴 配餐：</strong>烤羊肉、燉菜、BBQ</div><div class='content-item'><strong>💰 價格：</strong>$ - $$（超值）</div></div></div><div class='grape-detail half'><div class='detail-header nero-bg'><h3>Nero d'Avola</h3><p>西西里之王</p></div><div class='detail-content'><div class='content-item'><strong>🎨 視覺：</strong>深紅、濃郁</div><div class='content-item'><strong>👃 香氣：</strong>黑櫻桃、黑莓、巧克力、香料</div><div class='content-item'><strong>👅 口感：</strong>單寧堅實、酸度中、酒體飽滿</div><div class='content-item'><strong>🍷 代表：</strong>Cerasuolo di Vittoria DOCG（混釀）</div><div class='content-item'><strong>🍴 配餐：</strong>西西里烤肉、Caponata、陳年起司</div><div class='content-item'><strong>🌡️ 特色：</strong>耐熱品種，適應南部氣候</div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>📊 五大品種對比</h2><div class='comparison-table'><table><tr><th>品種</th><th>單寧</th><th>酸度</th><th>酒體</th><th>陳年潛力</th><th>價格帶</th><th>適飲場合</th></tr><tr><td><strong>Nebbiolo</strong></td><td>非常高</td><td>非常高</td><td>中-飽滿</td><td>10-30 年</td><td>$$$-$$$$</td><td>特殊場合</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sangiovese</strong></td><td>中-高</td><td>高</td><td>中-飽滿</td><td>5-30 年</td><td>$$-$$$</td><td>正餐、宴客</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Barbera</strong></td><td>低-中</td><td>高</td><td>中-飽滿</td><td>2-8 年</td><td>$-$$</td><td>日常飲用</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Montepulciano</strong></td><td>中</td><td>中</td><td>飽滿</td><td>3-10 年</td><td>$-$$</td><td>日常、BBQ</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Nero d'Avola</strong></td><td>中-高</td><td>中</td><td>飽滿</td><td>5-15 年</td><td>$$-$$$</td><td>正餐、地中海料理</td></tr></table></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Nebbiolo 是義大利最偉大的紅葡萄，釀造 Barolo 和 Barbaresco</div><div class='point'>✓ Sangiovese 是托斯卡納之魂，義大利種植最廣的品種</div><div class='point'>✓ Barbera 低單寧高酸度，是日常飲用的絕佳選擇</div><div class='point'>✓ Montepulciano 性價比極高，適合大眾消費</div><div class='point'>✓ Nero d'Avola 是西西里代表，適應炎熱氣候</div></div></section></div><style>.grape-overview{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:15px}.overview-card{background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);transition:transform .3s}.overview-card:hover{transform:translateY(-8px)}.rank{width:50px;height:50px;background:#8e44ad;color:#fff;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:700;margin:0 auto 12px}.grape-name{font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;margin:10px 0}.grape-region{color:#7f8c8d;font-size:.9rem;margin:5px 0}.grape-fame{color:#9b59b6;font-weight:600;margin-top:8px;font-size:.9rem}.grape-detail{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);margin:20px 0}.detail-header{padding:25px;color:#fff;text-align:center}.nebbiolo-bg{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c0392b,#e74c3c)}.sangiovese-bg{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d35400,#e67e22)}.barbera-bg{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8e44ad,#9b59b6)}.montepulciano-bg{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a085,#1abc9c)}.nero-bg{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2c3e50,#34495e)}.detail-header h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.8rem}.detail-header p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;opacity:.9}.detail-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;padding:25px}.detail-section h4{margin:0 0 12px;color:#8e44ad;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #ecf0f1;padding-bottom:8px}.detail-section ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:2}.detail-section li{color:#555}.detail-section strong{color:#2c3e50}.two-grapes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.half{box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.detail-content{padding:25px}.content-item{padding:12px 15px;margin:8px 0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f8f9fa,transparent);border-left:4px solid;line-height:1.6}.montepulciano-bg + .detail-content .content-item{border-color:#16a085}.nero-bg + .detail-content .content-item{border-color:#2c3e50}.comparison-table{background:#fff;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.comparison-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.95rem}.comparison-table th{background:#8e44ad;color:#fff;padding:14px;text-align:left;font-size:.9rem}.comparison-table td{padding:14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0}.comparison-table tr:hover{background:#f8f9fa}.comparison-table strong{color:#8e44ad}.key-points{display:grid;gap:10px}.point{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e8daef,transparent);padding:16px 22px;border-left:4px solid #8e44ad;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}</style>",
  "quiz": [
    {
      "question": "哪個品種被稱為「義大利之王」，釀造 Barolo 和 Barbaresco？",
      "options": ["Sangiovese", "Nebbiolo", "Barbera", "Montepulciano"],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Nebbiolo 是義大利最偉大的紅葡萄品種，用於釀造 Barolo 和 Barbaresco 等頂級酒款。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Barbera 的主要特色是？",
      "options": ["高單寧、低酸度", "低單寧、高酸度", "高單寧、高酸度", "低單寧、低酸度"],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Barbera 的獨特之處在於低單寧配合高酸度，使其非常適合日常飲用和配餐。"
    },
    {
      "question": "哪個品種是義大利種植最廣的紅葡萄？",
      "options": ["Nebbiolo", "Sangiovese", "Barbera", "Nero d'Avola"],
      "answer": 1,
      "explanation": "Sangiovese 是義大利種植最廣泛的紅葡萄品種，尤其在托斯卡納地區。"
    },
    {
      "question": "Nero d'Avola 主要產自哪個產區？",
      "options": ["Piemonte", "Tuscany", "Veneto", "Sicily"],
      "answer": 3,
      "explanation": "Nero d'Avola 是西西里島的代表性紅葡萄品種，被稱為「西西里之王」。"
    }
  ]
}
